            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not on its own. Studies comparing collagen with whey consistently find whey stimulates more muscle protein synthesis and larger muscle gains, even when extra leucine is added to the collagen. Bone broth protein is collagen-led, so the same logic applies. It can contribute to total daily protein, but a complete protein is the better choice after training."
